173
00:18:01,199 --> 00:18:04,815
The Prophet ﷺ into another narration reported by Imam Ahmed(امام احمد);

174
00:18:05,039 --> 00:18:12,081
one of his companions by the name of  Zil Assabe(ذلاسابع), or Zul Assabe(ذولاسابع) asked the Prophet ﷺ says;

175
00:18:12,594 --> 00:18:17,664
If we are tested, in other words, if we face a disaster, to live after you,

176
00:18:17,957 --> 00:18:20,124
