183
00:18:57,102 --> 00:18:59,893
Indeed the Prophet ﷺ said;

184
00:19:00,276 --> 00:19:03,169
In another Hadith(حدیث), he asked Abu Zarr(ابوذر),

185
00:19:03,516 --> 00:19:09,788
he says to Abu Zarr(ابوذر) , he says, Oh Abu Zarr(ابوذر), what should you do if you are forced to leave Madina?

