00:32:13,266 --> 00:32:16,238
and Allah سبحانه وتعالى granted for him two of those three things.

319
00:32:16,818 --> 00:32:22,998
He asked Allah سبحانه وتعالى that he is given a judgment, which is in agreement with Allah's judgment.

320
00:32:23,888 --> 00:32:27,098
So in other words, whatever the Prophet Suleman(سلیمان) will judge concerning something,

321
00:32:27,528 --> 00:32:33,613
as he's a prophet, he's also a judge, that his ruling would be as Allah was, and Allah gave him that.

322
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:42,499
The Prophet ﷺ tells us that he also asked Allah for a kingdom that nobody would have after him.

323
00:32:43,366 --> 00:32:48,808
And indeed Allah سبحانه وتعالى tells us this in the Qur'an in Surah Saad(صٓ) that He said;

324
00:32:48,855 --> 00:32:49,955
رَبِّ اغْفِرْ لِیْ

325
00:32:49,975 --> 00:32:51,275
Oh Allah forgive me.

326
00:32:51,595 --> 00:32:56,277
 وَهَبْ لِیْ مُلْكًا لَّا یَنْۢبَغِیْ لِاَحَدٍ مِّنْۢ بَعْدِیْۚ اِنَّكَ اَنْتَ الْوَهَّابُ۝

327
00:32:57,130 --> 00:33:03,619
Oh Allah, forgive me my sin and give me a kingdom a dominion which will not be given to anybody after me.

328
00:33:03,926 --> 00:33:07,931
You are the One, Who grants and bestows all things, You are Al Wahab(الوھاب).

329
00:33:09,431 --> 00:33:15,270
And Suleman(سلیمان)'s kingdom was such that even the Jinn(جن)s were under his command and his orders.

330
00:33:15,790 --> 00:33:23,960
His kingdom was such and his powers were such that he used to spend the morning in Jerusalem, and then when it would become hot,

331
00:33:24,407 --> 00:33:31,680
he would come, as the scholars of Tafseer(تفسیر) say, and spend the afternoon in Kabul, in Afghanistan in the mountains, where it's cool.

332
00:33:32,327 --> 00:33:34,548
Because the winds were under his command.

333
00:33:37,655 --> 00:33:44,315
And then he asked (the Prophet ﷺ tells us) that the Prophet Suleman(سلیمان) asks Allah a third thing which Allah doesn't grant, the Prophet Suleman(سلیمان).

334
00:33:45,427 --> 00:33:49,922
The Prophet Suleman(سلیمان) after building Bait-Ul-Maqdas(بیت المقدس), this Masjid-Al-Aqsa(مسجدالاقصٰی) says;

335
00:33:50,242 --> 00:34:01,344
He asks Allah عزوجل, that any man, and man here means man or woman, come forth from their house, only wanting to pray in this house, in this Masjid(مسجد),

336
00:34:01,751 --> 00:34:05,743
that he comes forth from his sins like the day his mother gives birth to him,

337
00:34:07,803 --> 00:34:11,522
the Prophet, ﷺ  says and we hope that Allah gives us this

338
00:34:12,855 --> 00:34:21,511
فنحن نرجو ان یکونو اللہ قد اطعنا ایاھا

339
00:34:24,424 --> 00:34:30,574
And we hope that Allah عزوجل gives us this gift.

340
00:34:31,213 --> 00:34:35,399
So look at this gift that the Prophet Suleman(سلیمان) asked of Allah عزوجل,

341
00:34:35,753 --> 00:34:39,593
and the Prophet ﷺ says; We hope that Allah has given it to us, since he didn't give it to the Prophet Suleman(سلیمان)

342
00:34:39,906 --> 00:34:41,793
that any one of us imagine now,

343
00:34:42,533 --> 00:34:50,062
that if you were to go and leave your household, not wanting to do anything, but just to pray a Salah(صلاۃ) in this Masjid Al Aqsa(مسجدالاقصٰی),

344
00:34:50,546 --> 00:34:56,044
that you would come out of that Masjid(مسجد) like the day your mother gave birth to you, meaning without sin.

345
00:34:57,517 --> 00:35:03,099
We know that the difficulties of Hajj(حج), that Hajj(حج) right, the Hajj Al Mabroor(حج المبرور) the Prophet ﷺ said;

346
00:35:03,359 --> 00:35:07,278
The blessed Hajj(حج) or the righteous Hajj(حج), is such that has no reward but paradise.

347
00:35:07,318 --> 00:35:13,205
In another narration, it is the one, who does this Hajj(حج), and he does not enter into argument or does not enter into sinfulness,

348
00:35:14,338 --> 00:35:18,245
he will be as the day in which his mother gave birth to him.

349
00:35:18,698 --> 00:35:20,224
But Hajj(حج) is a difficult task.

350
00:35:20,651 --> 00:35:28,243
It lasts for many days, and in order to hold yourself not to sin or not to get into dispute or argument is difficult

351
00:35:28,737 --> 00:35:30,763
because it is something which goes on for many days,

352
00:35:31,010 --> 00:35:35,804
but yet here you have the same reward for something which is much easier and takes much little time

353
00:35:36,117 --> 00:35:41,803
just to go to this Masjid(مسجد) for the only purpose of doing prayer there, it doesn't have to be an obligatory prayer,

354
00:35:41,970 --> 00:35:46,369
it can be a voluntary prayer, because the Hadith (حدیث) says Salah(صلاۃ) just in the absolute sense.

355
00:35:46,883 --> 00:35:53,843
And this is why Ibn Umarرضی اللہ عنہ, knowing this Hadith(حدیث), leaves Madina and goes to Jerusalem

356
00:35:54,027 --> 00:35:59,133
just to pray two Rakaah(رکعۃ)s and refuses to even drink a glass of water in the Masjid(مسجد)

357
00:36:00,693 --> 00:36:03,051
and says, I want to go just for this reason.

358
00:36:05,371 --> 00:36:10,267
So I have no other intention, and even though drinking water is obviously not something which is going to contradict praying.

359
00:36:10,753 --> 00:36:18,603
For we know in our Sharia(شریعۃ) that in the Nafila(نافلۃ) prayer, in the non obligatory prayer, it is permissible to take small sips of water.

360
00:36:19,736 --> 00:36:25,482
So one can even take a small sip of water in prayer, which means in Taraweeh(تراویح), if it's hot, you can take a small sip of water while you're praying.

361
00:36:25,588 --> 00:36:26,622
And this doesn't negate your prayer.

362
00:36:26,808 --> 00:36:31,120
Of course, in the obligatory prayer, to eat or to drink or to talk or to laugh, negates it.

363
00:36:31,187 --> 00:36:36,947
But for the voluntary prayer, the conditions are not as stringent as as with the obligatory prayer,

364
00:36:37,140 --> 00:36:42,063
yet Ibn Umar(ابنِ عمر) seeks not to even drink a water in Masjid Al Aqsa(مسجدالاقصٰی)

365
00:36:42,083 --> 00:36:48,180
because he doesn't want it, in any way to affect his chance of winning this reward.

366
00:36:52,383 --> 00:37:03,419
And so therefore, after the Prophet Suleman علیہ السلام, the children of Israel, of course, fall into great sin and go into idol worship.

367
00:37:03,439 --> 00:37:08,401
So Allah عزوجل punishes them with the Babylonian,

368
00:37:09,634 --> 00:37:14,734
or from Iraq, the person, Nebuchadnezzar, who comes and destroys Masjid Al Aqsa(مسجدالاقصٰی),

369
00:37:14,848 --> 00:37:17,874
as Allah سبحانه وتعالى says in Surah Al Isra(سورہ الاسرا)؛;

370
00:37:18,934 --> 00:37:22,672
that when the first promise comes, we will send to you people who are strong,

371
00:37:23,019 --> 00:37:28,434
and they will come and they will destroy, they'll enter into your homes and destroy the Masjid(مسجد).

372
00:37:29,514 --> 00:37:31,688
And he takes the children of Israel into captivity.

373
00:37:31,754 --> 00:37:39,147
And there in captivity, they have many prophets among them, the prophet Daniaal or Daniel علیہ السلام, which we will refer to, at the end of the lecture.

374
00:37:40,913 --> 00:37:46,329
And then Allah عزوجل  has mercy on the children of Israel, and they return back to Bait-Al-Maqdas(بیت المقدس).

375
00:37:46,409 --> 00:37:48,302
And Allah sends them other prophets.

376
00:37:50,089 --> 00:37:54,175
And we find again the Prophet ﷺ giving us more knowledge of the other prophets and what happens

377
00:37:54,935 --> 00:38:04,415
for we find that Allah سبحانه وتعالى tells us the story of Maryam's mother, that she says when she is pregnant

378
00:38:04,821 --> 00:38:07,728
 اِنِّیْ نَذَرْتُ لَكَ مَا فِیْ بَطْنِیْ مُحَرَّرً

379
00:38:09,289 --> 00:38:12,770
That I have given you Allah عزوجل as a vow.

380
00:38:13,240 --> 00:38:14,393
What is in my belly,

381
00:38:14,993 --> 00:38:21,179
meaning in order that what I'm going to give birth to, will must be in Masjid Al Aqsa(مسجدالاقصٰی) worshiping Allah عزوجل .

382
00:38:21,572 --> 00:38:22,559
And that was?

383
00:38:22,919 --> 00:38:26,642
She gave birth not to a boy but she gave birth to a girl and that was Maryam Bint e Imran(مریم بنت عمران).

384
00:38:29,288 --> 00:38:34,184
And likewise we find in the Quran that Allah سبحانه وتعالى tells us about Zakaria(زکریاؑ),

385
00:38:35,037 --> 00:38:40,436
that every time, he entered into Masjid Al Aqsa(مسجدالاقصٰی), he would find Maryam Binte Imran(مریم بنت عمران) there.

386
00:38:42,516 --> 00:38:47,409
And likewise, we find in the Sunnah(سنۃ), the Prophet ﷺ telling us about

387
00:38:47,456 --> 00:38:53,165
the Prophet Yahya( یحیٰؑ), the son of Zakaria(زکریاؑ ) and the prophet Eesa Ibne Maryam( عيسٰى ابن مریمؑ ) and Masjid Al Aqsa(مسجدالاقصٰی),

388
00:38:53,716 --> 00:38:58,904
for in the Hadith(حدیث) of Al Haris al Ashari(حارث الاشعری) reported by Imam Ahmed(امام احمد), the Prophet ﷺ says that

389
00:38:58,944 --> 00:39:03,004
Allah commanded Yahya bin Zakaria( یحی بن زکریا) with five commands

390
00:39:03,363 --> 00:39:07,622
that he acts upon it, and that he commands the children of Israel to act upon it.

391
00:39:08,355 --> 00:39:14,114
But Yahya Bin Zakaria(یحی بن زکریا) was slow to command the children of Israel to act upon it.

392
00:39:14,694 --> 00:39:21,124
So Allah commanded Eesa Ibne Maryam(عيسٰى ابن مریم) to tell Yahya bin Zakaria(یحی بن زکریا) either command the children of Israel with it,

393
00:39:21,377 --> 00:39:23,444
or I will command the children of Israel with it.

394
00:39:24,117 --> 00:39:27,632
The Prophet ﷺ  tells us that Yahya bin Zakaria(یحی بن زکریا) says;

395
00:39:28,099 --> 00:39:31,535
I'm afraid if you are to tell the children of Israel before me;

396
00:39:33,042 --> 00:39:35,444
to his cousin, Eesa Ibne Maryam علیہ السلام, another prophet of Allah,

397
00:39:35,464 --> 00:39:47,813
I am afraid if you were to tell them before me, then Allah عزوجل will either cause the earth to swallow me up or will punish me.

398
00:39:48,533 --> 00:39:52,648
So Yahya bin Zakaria(یحی بن زکریا) gathers the people; the Prophet ﷺ says, in Bait-Al-Maqdas(بیت المقدس).

399
00:39:53,179 --> 00:39:58,244
So the Masjid(مسجد) is filled.

400
00:39:58,591 --> 00:40:01,640
And they're sitting there and then he tells them about Allah's commands,

401
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:07,120
five commands that of Tawheed(توحید) and Prayer and Fasting and Charity and Zikr(ذکر).

402
00:40:07,676 --> 00:40:15,829
Then the Prophet ﷺ says; And I add to this five commands, and the Prophet ﷺ mentioned As-Sam’aa Wa Ta'aa(السمع وطاعۃ) and Jihad(جہاد) and Hijrah(ھجرۃ).

403
00:40:16,356 --> 00:40:17,176
نعم

404
00:40:18,169 --> 00:40:23,422
And then, of course we find that because the Jews, the children of Israel, didn't obey their prophets,

405
00:40:23,475 --> 00:40:30,264
they killed Yahya ibne Zakaria علیہ السلام according to the books of tafseer(تفسیر), and they attempted to kill the Prophet Eesa عليه السلام,

406
00:40:30,531 --> 00:40:34,114
but as Allah said they neither killed him nor crucified him but Allah raised him unto Him.

407
00:40:34,441 --> 00:40:41,841
Than Allah سبحانه وتعالى then sends the Romans to destroy Masjid Al-Aqsa(مسجد الاقصٰی) in the year 70 after Eesa Ibn-e-Maryam عليه السلام.

408
00:40:43,794 --> 00:40:48,741
And then history continues and Jahiliya(جاہلیہ) fills the earth,

409
00:40:49,561 --> 00:40:54,666
until Allah سبحانه وتعالى sends as a mercy to all the worlds; the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ.

410
00:40:55,906 --> 00:40:59,045
And in the revelation of the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ;

411
00:40:59,417 --> 00:41:05,433
reference after reference to this Masjid Al-Aqsa(مسجد الاقصٰی) into these lands, as we quoted some and as we'll quote a few more.

412
00:41:06,413 --> 00:41:08,983
For instance, a Surah(سورۃ) which I think all of us have memorized,

413
00:41:09,293 --> 00:41:13,128
وَ التِّیْنِ وَ الزَّیْتُوْنِ ۝ وَ طُوْرِ سِیْنِیْنَ ۝ وَ هٰذَا الْبَلَدِ الْاَمِیْنِ۝

414
00:41:14,595 --> 00:41:16,500
By the fig and the olive.

415
00:41:16,894 --> 00:41:20,627
The fig refers to Damascus, and the olive refers to Jerusalem.

416
00:41:21,220 --> 00:41:25,227
Damascus being the place where the prophet Eesaعليه السلام will come at the end of time,

417
00:41:25,547 --> 00:41:28,057
and Jerusalem being the place where he used to give dawah unto.

418
00:41:29,184 --> 00:41:30,277
وَطُوْرِ سِیْنِیْنَ۝

419
00:41:30,310 --> 00:41:36,086
And the Mount Sinai, where the prophet Musa عليه السلام received revelation.

420
00:41:36,398 --> 00:41:37,632
وَ هٰذَا الْبَلَدِ الْاَمِیْن۝

421
00:41:37,653 --> 00:41:43,071
then this secure city, meaning Mecca, where the Prophet ﷺ received revelation.

422
00:41:43,658 --> 00:41:46,074
Likewise, a very famous passage in Surah Noor(سورۃ النور),

423
00:41:46,501 --> 00:41:52,114
even the passage is general, has been understood by some of the Salaf(سلف) to be specific where Allah سبحانه وتعالى says;

424
00:41:52,547 --> 00:41:58,303
فِیْ بُیُوْتٍ اَذِنَ اللّٰهُ اَنْ تُرْفَعَ وَ یُذْكَرَ فِیْهَا اسْمُهٗۙ

425
00:41:58,876 --> 00:42:09,499
In certain homes or houses of worship where Allah سبحانه وتعالى has permitted that His name will be announced and be mentioned there.

426
00:42:09,893 --> 00:42:15,148
Ikrama(عکرمہ), the student of the prophet's companion Ibn Abbas رضی اللہ عنہ

427
00:42:15,408 --> 00:42:17,022
the Tabiee(تابعی), Ikrama(عکرمہ) says;

428
00:42:17,375 --> 00:42:25,524
These places of worship are the Kaaba(کعبہ) and Masjid-E-Quba(مسجدِ قبا) and the Masjid(مسجد) of Madina and the Masjid of Bait-Al-Maqdas(بیت المقدس), meaning Masjid Al-Aqsa(مسجد الاقصٰی).

429
00:42:27,150 --> 00:42:32,896
And likewise, the many Hadith(حدیث) of the Prophet ﷺ , which we've cited a number of those.

430
00:42:33,896 --> 00:42:39,493
And so the Prophet ﷺ, from his practical Seerah(سیرۃ), and from the revelation which He revealed,

431
00:42:39,873 --> 00:42:44,139
connected him to the prophets, and connected him to Bait-Al-Maqdas(بیت المقدس).

432
00:42:45,832 --> 00:42:52,974
And so therefore upon the Prophet ﷺ life, he prepared the Muslims to take Bait-Al-Maqdas(بیت المقدس),

433
00:42:53,127 --> 00:42:58,176
because Tawheed(توحید) has to be completed and this message confirms the other Messages, the Messengers.

434
00:42:59,433 --> 00:43:11,454
So we find that the Prophet ﷺ in the eighth year of Hijrah(ھجرۃ), has this battle of Mota(موتہ),

435
00:43:12,474 --> 00:43:24,960
which he sends 3000s of his companions in order to fight the Christian Romans, the Byzantines.

436
00:43:25,514 --> 00:43:30,813
And then Mota(موتہ) is near what we now is area in Jordan called Petra and Mota(موتہ) is near that area.

437
00:43:31,526 --> 00:43:35,050
So he sends as incharge of this army, Zaid ibne Harisa(زید ابن حارثہ).

438
00:43:36,408 --> 00:43:42,094
And afterwards he says that if Zaid ibne Harisa (زید ابن حارثہ) is to die, then Jafar Ibn-E-Abi Talib(جعفر ابن ابی طالب) is to lead the companions, in this battle.

439
00:43:42,694 --> 00:43:46,794
And if Jaffer Ibn-Abi-Talib(جعفر ابن ابی طالب ) is to die, then Abdullah Bin Rawaha(عبداللہ بن رواحہ) is to lead the companions.

440
00:43:47,381 --> 00:43:51,893
And so the battle continues; 3000 of the Sahaba(صحابہ) fight the Christian Romans,

441
00:43:52,166 --> 00:43:56,859
and Zaid Ibn E Harisa(زید ابن حارثہ) is given Shahadah(شہادۃ) and then Jaffer Ibn Abi Talib(جعفر ابن ابی طالب) is given shahada(شہادۃ)

442
00:43:57,125 --> 00:43:59,272
and then Abdullah bin Rawaha(عباللہ بن رواحہ) has given Shahada(شہادۃ).

443
00:43:59,572 --> 00:44:05,895
And then Allah سبحانه وتعالى decrees that Khalid Ibn Waleed(خالد بن ولید) leads the battle, and they defeat the Romans.

444
00:44:06,909 --> 00:44:16,687
Now the Romans and the other Arab allies were not satisfied with this, so they prepare even a greater army now to invade Madina.

445
00:44:17,053 --> 00:44:24,026
So when the Prophet ﷺ gets word of this, he commands all the believers to go out and to fight the Romans,

446
00:44:24,433 --> 00:44:30,615
and he goes out with 30,000 of his companions, leading them himself for the battle of Tabuk(تبوک)

447
00:44:32,035 --> 00:44:38,097
and Allah سبحانه وتعالى describes this battle of Tabuk(تبوک), the journey to the Battle of Tabuk(تبوک) in Surah Toba(سورہ توبہ),

448
00:44:38,797 --> 00:44:44,829
because the hypocrites were exposed by not going forth in this battle, by staying back in Madina.

449
00:44:45,836 --> 00:44:51,286
And Allah سبحانه وتعالى describes to us, the severe heat in which they went forth from Madina to Tabuk(تبوک)

450
00:44:51,326 --> 00:44:56,435
which is the furthest northern region of Arabia, next to Syria, and Ash-Sham(الشام) areas.

451
00:44:58,388 --> 00:45:06,935
And the Prophet ﷺ stayed there for a month, and the Christians among the Byzantines, the Europeans and their Arab allies, are afraid to show up.

452
00:45:07,775 --> 00:45:14,997
So the Prophet ﷺ has returned, but yes there was no battle, but the fear of the Roman army is now broken amongst the Muslims,

453
00:45:16,611 --> 00:45:20,037
just like now the Americans; Everybody's Muslim world is fear to the Americans, right?

454
00:45:20,303 --> 00:45:26,855
When the one battle will come and their Might is broken, then the fear of that army and their military force will come to an end.

455
00:45:28,329 --> 00:45:30,862
But the Prophet ﷺ is not satisfied with that.

456
00:45:30,922 --> 00:45:35,971
So then he commands, in the final year of his life, just prior to his death, that Usama(اسامہ), the son of Zaid(زید),

457
00:45:36,425 --> 00:45:42,704
 Zaid Bin Harisa's(زید بن حارث ) son who was died in that battle, to lead an army against the Byzantines.

458
00:45:43,751 --> 00:45:51,432
And he commands them that they place that they should go forth until they place their troops in Al Balqa(البلقاء).

459
00:45:53,363 --> 00:45:55,332
However, the Prophet ﷺ dies.

460
00:45:57,239 --> 00:45:59,881
The Prophet ﷺ dies, and Abu Bakar(ابوبکرؓ) is the Khalifah(خلیفۃ).

461
00:46:01,134 --> 00:46:05,177
And a new issue occurs, that the Arabs apostated.

462
00:46:05,777 --> 00:46:06,530
So what to do?

463
00:46:07,010 --> 00:46:10,544
We have an army ready to go forth, and we have Arabia now as apostated.

464
00:46:11,077 --> 00:46:15,776
The Sahabah(صحابہ) told Abu Bakar(ابوبکرؓ), we need these, every single man to fight the apostates.

465
00:46:15,830 --> 00:46:17,830
They will deal with Ash-Sham(الشام).

466
00:46:17,910 --> 00:46:25,803
Abu Bakr(ابوبکرؓ) says, By Allah, I will not send back an army which the Prophet ﷺ  has tied its banner to go forth.

467
00:46:26,490 --> 00:46:30,329
And he says that even if the dogs of Madina were to enter into Madina,

468
00:46:30,349 --> 00:46:35,269
because there are no more men there, the wild dogs and bite upon the legs of the Mothers of the Believers.

469
00:46:35,343 --> 00:46:40,392
And among the Mothers of the Believers is his daughter, Aisha رضی اللہ عنھا, I will not send this army back.

470
00:46:41,878 --> 00:46:43,337
So they go forth.

471
00:46:45,037 --> 00:46:47,270
And then Abu Bakr(ابوبکرؓ) used to say,

472
00:46:47,757 --> 00:46:55,286
It is more beloved to me that I take over a small village in Ash-Sham(الشام); Then I take over a big city in Iraq

